# ui-morph project

- pnpm workspace: `packages/react` (library), `packages/api` (Express + Postgres + Gemini agent), `demo/` (app). Read `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
- `docs/PLAN.md` is outdated in places; trust source + `AGENTS.md` over the plan when they conflict.
- React library must support React 17+: no `useId`, `useSyncExternalStore`, or React 19-only APIs.
- Minimize diff scope; no drive-by refactors. No commits unless the user requests them.
- Agent edits persist via `POST /agent/message`; manual edits save on toolbar Save. `childOrder` uses segment IDs, not full morph paths.
